# DerailValleyModv2 (Yard Master Suite v2)

Clean-room rewrite. v1 `DerailValleyMod` is a reference library only — do not bolt onto it.

**Read first:** `docs/YMS_v2_Onboarding_Guide.md`, `docs/YMS_v2_Architecture_Plan.md`, `docs/Unity_PubSub_Best_Practices.md`, `docs/Research_and_Leverage_Manifesto.md`.

**Tracked truth:** `AGENT_HANDOFF.md`, `PM_PLAN.md`, `TEST_PLAN.md`, `docs/PROJECT_STATUS.md`, `docs/Versioning_and_Release_Strategy.md`, `docs/HTP.md` (panacea CI), [`docs/HTP Playbook for AI Agents.md`](../../docs/HTP%20Playbook%20for%20AI%20Agents.md) (gather-once / HTP workflow). Skills live in `.cursor/skills/` — do not rename their titles on upstream merge.

## Project invariants (this repo)

- Zero-allocation on hot paths: no new objects, lists, or uncached strings in `Update()` loops.
- Pub/Sub: Type A (`Action` + primitives/structs) on the main thread; Type B mailbox for heavy math. Unsubscribe in `OnDisable`/`OnDestroy`.
- Harmony Prefix/Postfix only unless an ADR says otherwise.

## Hard rules (one file each — read those, do not recopy)

| Failure mode | Rule |
|--------------|------|
| Docs/handoff prose before they can test | `wrap-on-command.mdc` (ceremony waits for **CMPH** / **SWAT**) |
| Next story while current is uncommitted | `one-story-one-ship.mdc` |
| Ask for smoke without Mods deploy | `deploy-before-smoke.mdc` |
| Smoke PASS with no hitch vs prior | `chat-performance-summary.mdc` (print numbers **in chat**) |
| Smoke lock / T2 line with no Core test | `smoke-gates-tier1-ci.mdc` + `testing.mdc` evidence loop |
| Second test repo / HTP-as-epic / cab-debug HTP locks / invent full-map harvest | [htp.mdc](htp.mdc) + [`docs/HTP Playbook for AI Agents.md`](../../docs/HTP%20Playbook%20for%20AI%20Agents.md) — gather once, simulate forever; Epic **14** is Maps desk, not HTP; [docs/HTP.md](../../docs/HTP.md) |
| Cursor commit/PR attribution | `no-cursor-commit-attribution.mdc` |
| Tiers, T2 logs, harvest | `testing.mdc` + `TEST_TDD.md` |
| Land on `main` vs epic reviews | `wrap-on-command.mdc`: **CMPH** = short land work + permission; **SWAT** = review/Release work + permission |
| Gemini drop | `gemini-handoff.mdc` (`docs/gemini/`, not a second pack) |
| Version vs SemVer guess | `pm-versioning.mdc` (`2.{Epic}.{Story}` from PM_PLAN) |
| Epic close without GitHub Release | `epic-close.mdc` + `pm-versioning.mdc` (Nexus waits until playable) |
| Branch / commit / push | `github-feature-workflow` skill + AGENT_HANDOFF Git workflow |
| Merge to `main` without CMPH work **and** permission | `no-auto-merge-main.mdc` + `wrap-on-command.mdc` |
| Rewired / `ControlBindings.json` poison from mod hotkeys | `input-hotkeys-unity-only.mdc` |
